seq. Incumbents are required to self-report convictions and those in Youth Programs may have additional Criminal History Checks every 2 years. Working Conditions/Schedule: This is a pooled posting. Salary Range: Anticipated Start Date: 2026-09-16 Anticipated End Date:"
